5,1,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm looking forward to this. To make sure we aren't just repeating old mistakes, I want to dive into the two pilots from eight years ago and the completion records of the earlier accessibility programme.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To ensure our ambitions don't outpace our actual capacity, I shall examine the roster books for the late-turn pool and the crew establishment and maintenance contract. Logic suggests we check our resources first.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello. I think it's important to understand where passengers are actually losing time. I'd like to look into the timed runs and crowd counts mid-city, as well as the journey audits on where minutes go.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Hello everyone. It is a pleasure to meet you all. I worry about the things we cannot see on a map, so I will look into the joint operators' committee minutes and the contingency pricing inside the pre-war shells.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Hello. I believe we should be mindful of our long-term obligations. I will look into the balances in the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees and paving rates to understand our true financial commitments.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"It seems we've all got our niches covered! @Benjamin, your focus on resources is sensible, but I hope we don't ignore the lessons of the past. Let's see if history has any warnings for us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, history is a wonderful teacher, provided the students are paying attention. I simply wish to ensure that the ""lessons"" we learn are actually executable by the people on the ground. Logic dictates we cannot build castles in the air.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I agree with both of you. While history and resources are vital, I hope we can also focus on the actual passenger experience. It's easy to overlook the small delays that really add up for people.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are all so thoughtful. @Midori, you are quite right to think of the passengers. I only hope we can find a path that is smooth for everyone, without any hidden surprises along the way.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the sentiment. I only hope that by clarifying our current financial obligations, we can avoid the usual disputes over funding and focus on what the network truly requires for the future.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm feeling quite optimistic! It's a lovely mix of perspectives. @Jonathan, I'm curious if your ledger search will reveal any ghosts of projects past that we're still paying for. History has a way of lingering in the budget.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@May, your fascination with ghosts is charming, though I prefer the living. I suspect the real ghosts are the exhausted crews we've forgotten to account for in these grand designs. Let us hope the numbers are honest.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I hope the numbers are honest too. @Benjamin, I'm interested to see if the crew schedules align with where the passengers are struggling most. It would be wonderful if we could balance efficiency with a better experience.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,It is so lovely to see you all collaborating like this. I hope we can find a way to make the work easier for the staff and the journey kinder for the passengers.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to see such harmony. I believe that once we understand the actual costs of our contracts, we can make decisions based on reality rather than optimistic projections.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,"I'll keep a keen eye on those old reports. It would be such a shame to fall in love with a ""new"" idea that already failed once. Let's see what the archives have to tell us!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I shall await the revelations of the archives and the ledgers with a measured curiosity. Until then, I remain hopeful that our final choice will be one that our staff can actually deliver.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'm looking forward to seeing what we all discover. I hope we can find a solution that truly respects the passengers' time and makes their daily journeys a bit more pleasant.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,1,4,pass,Midori,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"I wish you all the best of luck with your research. I shall be waiting patiently to see what we find, hoping for a plan that brings peace of mind to everyone involved.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,1,4,pass,Shizue,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I wish you all a productive search. I will be here, quietly reviewing the figures, to ensure we don't commit ourselves to a future we cannot actually afford.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
